📋 BUSINESS RULES & PAYLOAD SPECIFICATIONS:
• Endpoint: POST /api/v1/messages/:chatId
• Authentication: Bearer JWT Token required (sender must be a chat participant)
• Body:
  - text (string, optional if attachments provided, max 4000 chars)
  - attachments (string | string[], optional)
• Chat Side Effects: Updates Chat.lastMessage and Chat.lastMessageAt
• Response: { success: true, message: 'Message sent successfully', data: IMessage }

